<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets call warrants on Hutchison shrs.</title>
<headline>BZW sets call warrants on Hutchison shrs.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Thursday it has launched 85 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hutchison Whampoa Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$51.075	PREMIUM	 13.08 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$1.31	  GEARING	 4.33x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   20.APR.98	PAYDATE	 11.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG	LISTING DATE  13.MAR.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$56.75	 EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
